-- Dates, weekdays, ordinals and arithmetic.
2026-07-25
1900-01-01
2400-12-31
2000-02-29
2028-02-29
-- Unpadded fields are accepted; the constraints care about the
-- value, not the spelling.
2026-7-25
-- Day arithmetic, forwards and backwards, across year ends.
2026-07-25 +120
2026-07-25 -30
2026-12-31 +1
2027-01-01 -1
2024-02-28 +1
2023-02-28 +1
-- Spans.
--between 2026-01-01 2026-12-25
--between 2026-07-25 2026-07-26
--between 2026-07-26 2026-07-25
--between 1900-01-01 2400-12-31
-- February 29th of a leap year.
--leapday 2028
--leapday 2000
-- Laziness: the date is parsed but never demanded, so neither the
-- field refinements nor mkDate's precondition fire.
--syntax 2026-02-31
--syntax 2500-01-01
--help
